#ASSERT `Under Article 25(4), as a provider of a general-purpose AI model, have I and the provider of the high-risk AI system specified by written agreement the necessary information, capabilities, technical access and other assistance for my general-purpose AI model that is used or integrated in it` (Date 1 1 2028) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` (Date 15 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE -- Sseat35 Art 25(4), l.487 (the carve-out for free and open-source suppliers excepts general-purpose AI models) | Guide: the carve-out reads "other than general-purpose AI models"
#ASSERT `Under Article 18(1), as a provider of an AI system, does the period for keeping my documentation run on the date asked` (Date 2 9 2038) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` (Date 1 9 2028) FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE -- Sseat36 Art 18(1), l.414 (placed 2028-09-01; asked 2038-09-02) | Guide: period fixed by the text (ruling (a))
#ASSERT `Under Article 26(6), as a deployer of an AI system, do I keep the logs automatically generated by the high-risk AI system, to the extent they are under my control, for a period appropriate to its intended purpose, of at least six months` (Date 1 1 2028) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` (Date 15 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE 5 FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE -- Sseat37 Art 26(6), l.499 (five months) | Guide: "of at least six months"
#ASSERT `Under Article 23(5), as an importer, do I keep a copy of the certificate issued by the notified body, where applicable, of the instructions for use, and of the EU declaration of conformity for 10 years` (Date 2 9 2038) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` (Date 1 9 2028) FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE -- Sseat38 Art 23(5), l.457 (placed 2028-09-01; asked 2038-09-02) | Guide: period fixed by the text (ruling (a))
#ASSERT `Under Article 24(1), as a distributor, have I verified, before making the high-risk AI system available on the market, the CE marking, the declaration of conformity, the instructions for use and the compliance of the provider and the importer` (Date 1 1 2028) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` (Date 15 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE -- Sseat39 Art 24(1), l.462
#ASSERT `Under Article 26(10), as a deployer of an AI system, have I requested an authorisation for the use of the post-remote biometric identification system` (Date 1 1 2028) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` (Date 15 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE -- Sseat40 Art 26(10), l.504 (requested after 49 hours: question restated as the single yes/no the encoding asks) | Guide: "no later than 48 hours"
